as put together at a  parking lot on the outskirts of Warsaw  we have received one-third of the money  we were applying for from the city of  Warsaw and which meant that we had to  start building without having the whole  Sun so we had to spend this 1/3 on what  was to steal construction but then the  rest of money we had to find it  somewhere private donors helped a Polish  Art Foundation owns the house wedging  the steel frame into the gap was a  challenge carrot house is one Chesnee  prays and calls from potential customers  around the world another possibility for  a small house is actually here filling  building gaps has become Chesney's new  mission  Ketut house he says is just the  beginning  net kakarrot lives mostly in tel-aviv  when he's not in Warsaw carat house is  used by artists I couldn't imagine  myself living here eh  but they could imagine it as their  working studio like I could imagine  myself coming here every day for a few  hours or writing and thinking for carat  the narrow house is inspirational he  says it's architect has given tangible  shape to a crazy idea
 

